<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.1.1>	Gloriam deo in excelsis hodie
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.1.2>	Caelestis primum cecinit exercitus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.1.3>	Pax angelorum et in terra uocibus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.1.4>	Uera descendit.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.2.1>	Hodie caeli facti sunt melliflui,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.2.2>	Et mare dulces undas blando gurgite
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.2.3>	Aequauit, lento respirante sibilo
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.2.4>	Flatu sereno.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.3.1>	Astra polorum, rutilanti radio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.3.2>	Suffusa, lactis irrorant dulcedinem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.3.3>	Totus exultat letabundo gaudio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.3.4>	Gauisus mundus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.4.1>	In hora, quando Iesus Christus dominus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.4.2>	Nasci dignatus est sacra de uirgine,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.4.3>	Dulcis, suauis ac desiderabilis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.4.4>	Bethleem in orbe.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.5.1>	Angusti cunas pertulit presepii,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.5.2>	Feno iacere non abhorret dominus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.5.3>	Summa qui patris sedebat in dextera,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.5.4>	Rex angelorum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.6.1>	Pannis uelatus, uili strictus fascia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.6.2>	Inclusus paruis lacrimabat cunulis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.6.3>	Mater beata sancta premit ubera
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.6.4>	De caelo plena.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.7.1>	Sanctus sacratae fecundauit spiritus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.7.2>	Uirginis uuluam, uerbum caro factum est,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.7.3>	Et habitauit in nobis omnipotens
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.7.4>	Filius dei.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.8.1>	Gabrihel ante predixit archangelus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.8.2>	Quando felicem salutauit uirginem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.8.3>	"Paries" inquid "filium, Emmanuhel
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.8.4>	Nomen habebit."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.9.1>	Pastores erant proximis in pascuis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.9.2>	Bethleem ab urbe, noctis sub silentio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.9.3>	Instabant suos supra greges uigiles,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.9.4>	O quam beati.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.10.1>	Claritas dei cincxit illos fulgida,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.10.2>	Angelus inquit: "Nolite pauescere,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.10.3>	En ego modo magnum namque gaudium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.10.4>	Nuntio uobis.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.11.1>	Erit quod omni seculo mirabile,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.11.2>	Hodie quia uobis Christus dominus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.11.3>	Natus est Bethleem Dauidis in oppido,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.11.4>	Saluator mundi.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.12.1>	Hoc uobis signum erit: in presepio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.12.2>	Infantem pannis inuolutum positum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.12.3>	Inuenietis cum Maria pariter
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.12.4>	Matre beata."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.13.1>	Subito facta fulgentis milicie
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.13.2>	Est multitudo caelestis exercitus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.13.3>	Eodem simul angelo cum flammeo
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.13.4>	Ualde preclara.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.14.1>	Gloriam deo in excelsis sydera
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.14.2>	Plena sonabant, pax et in hominibus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.14.3>	Auditur bonae uoluntatis uocibus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.14.4>	In terra sanctis.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.15.1>	Pastores namque loquebantur inuicem:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.15.2>	"Eamus usque Bethleem celeriter
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.15.3>	Et uideamus hoc de uerbo qualiter
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.15.4>	Angelus dixit."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.16.1>	Venerunt ergo, inuenerunt puerum,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.16.2>	Angelus sicut dixit, in presepio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.16.3>	Positum, sanctam genetricem uirginem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.16.4>	Ioseph praesente.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.17.1>	In caelo stella nouo clara radio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.17.2>	Refulsit, ante que numquam resplenduit,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.17.3>	Clarior cunctis astris, mundo nunciat
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.17.4>	Gaudium magnum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.18.1>	Hanc stellam magi fulgore perspicuo
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.18.2>	In oriente uiderunt resplendere:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.18.3>	"Hoc signum" fantur "tam famosum, nobile
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.18.4>	Regis est magni.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.19.1>	Eamus ergo, inquiramus ubi est,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.19.2>	Et offeramus illi saltim munera
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.19.3>	Nostris oblata de thesauris optima,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.19.4>	Aurum, thus, myrram."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.20.1>	Haec tria magnum demonstrant mysterium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.20.2>	Dona, que deo hominique dederant
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.20.3>	Tres magi, sancto perdocente spiritu
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.20.4>	More diuino.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.21.1>	In auro regni signat excellentiam,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.21.2>	In thure summum sacerdotem typicat,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.21.3>	Per myrram Christi sepulturam mystice
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.21.4>	Optime docet.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.22.1>	Ecce uenerunt magi Hierosolimam
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.22.2>	Dicentes: "Stellam uidimus perfulgidam
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.22.3>	In oriente. Vbi est qui natus est
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.22.4>	Rex Iudaeorum?"
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.23.1>	Herodes magno timore perterritus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.23.2>	Reuolui sacras prophetarum paginas
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.23.3>	Praecepit scribis: "Legite si uerum est.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.23.4>	Scriptura teste."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.24.1>	Prophetam dudum dixisse commemorant:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.24.2>	"Et tu Bethleem, terra Iuda minima
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.24.3>	Nequaquam eris, ex te dux egreditur,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.24.4>	Iacob qui regit."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.25.1>	Herodes magis clam uocatis inquiens:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.25.2>	"Ite, uidete ubi est, recurrite,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.25.3>	Referte michi, ut et ego ueniens
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.25.4>	Adorem eum."
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.26.1>	Vulpes Herodes, cur cauda dissimulas
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.26.2>	Predam captare, qui beluino gutture
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.26.3>	Sanguinem sitis, agni carnes esuris,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.26.4>	Lupe crudelis?
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.27.1>	Non uales tuam saciare rabiem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.27.2>	Non agnus ille singularis moritur.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.27.3>	Nam, uelis nolis, ipse rex est Israel,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.27.4>	Rerum creator.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.28.1>	Mori dignatur alio in tempore,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.28.2>	Quando de cruce preciosi fuderit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.28.3>	Sanguinis undam, que mundi mortifera
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.28.4>	Crimina tollat.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.29.1>	Quid fremis, pestis? Iste rex omnipotens
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.29.2>	Non querit tuum regnum. Tibi poterat
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.29.3>	Donare suum, si non esses perfidus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.29.4>	Ualde superbus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.30.1>	Quos iugulasti teneros agniculos
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.30.2>	Sanguinulento, maledicte, gladio,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.30.3>	Ablactat uiuos in ouile proprio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.30.4>	Pastor benignus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.31.1>	Euntes magi, stella noua praeuia
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.31.2>	Hos precedebat, donec uenit, steterat
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.31.3>	Ubi tunc puer erat in cunabulis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.31.4>	Redemptor orbis.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.32.1>	O quam perualde magno magi gaudio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.32.2>	Uidentes stellam sunt gauisi. Protinus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.32.3>	Intrantes domum inuenerunt puerum,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.32.4>	Uirginis prolem.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.33.1>	Qui procedentes flexis cum genibus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.33.2>	Adorauerunt, apertis de thesauris
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.33.3>	Aurum, thus, myrram obtulerunt domino,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.33.4>	Regi deoque.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.34.1>	In somnis Perse ne redirent caelitus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.34.2>	Sunt ad Herodem perfidum ammoniti.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.34.3>	Suam reuersi sunt uiam per aliam
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.34.4>	In regionem.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.35.1>	Illusum demens se uidens rex impius
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.35.2>	A magis, Bethleem misit, cunctos pueros
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.35.3>	Mox a bimatu et infra per gladium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.35.4>	Mandat extingui.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.36.1>	O quam crudelis saeuaque sententia.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.36.2>	Mactare iubes teneram infanciam,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.36.3>	Insciam mali. Cur non parcis, impie,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.36.4>	Lacteae proli?
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.37.1>	Vox in excelsis, heu, quam tristis resonat,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.37.2>	Ploratus multus, ululatus maximus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.37.3>	Maternus luctus frustra premit ubera
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.37.4>	Nullo sugente.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.38.1>	Saluete, flores martyrum candiduli,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.38.2>	Respersi tamen rore sed purpureo,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.38.3>	Felices nati hac in luce rosuli,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.38.4>	Pulchri, tenelli.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.39.1>	Caelestis prorsus manibus angelicis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.39.2>	Collecti estis in canistro positi,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.39.3>	Agni sub throno quam bene reconditi
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.39.4>	In sempiternum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.40.1>	Herodes iacet in profundo tartari
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.40.2>	Combustus flammis, laceratus uermibus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.40.3>	Pice decoctus, dissipatus sulphure,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.40.4>	Infelix ille.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.41.1>	In paradyso uos, famosi pueri,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.41.2>	Aureas domos fontesque lactifluos,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.41.3>	Mellitos modo possidetis riuulos,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.41.4>	Semper felices.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.42.1>	Gloria sanctae trinitati unice,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.42.2>	Patri natoque, flamini paraclito,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.42.3>	Et nunc et ultra per inmensa secula
<paulin_aquil. carm. 7.42.4>	Sit semper. Amen.
